See AGENTS.md for the canonical project rules. Read it before editing.

Key invariants:
- Tailwind colors are CSS-variable-driven (themed). No hardcoded hex in web/src/**.
- Use components/Select.tsx and components/ConfirmDialog.tsx (useConfirm) instead of native <select> / window.confirm.
- Every admin route needs requireAuth + requireOrgRole.
- Every mutating admin call calls audit(...).
- Changing code without updating docs is banned. See AGENTS.md §4.7 for the doc sync table.
